  "_about": "The fourteen pet species (SPEC.md › Pets and Power Level; legacy/site/js/pets.js DEFAULT_SPECIES reskinned to the grimdark palette, plus the Grazing Maw, the Mucklings and Notorious Moon from the Named Legendaries section). Elements are the six secret hex colours. `pool` says which Triple Pet Wheel pools the species sits in: 'common' (left wheel), 'region' (middle wheel, weighted by `regionBias`), 'rare' (right wheel, with dud segments). `onlyRegion` restricts hatching to eggs found in that region (Grazing Maw: Blackwood; Notorious Moon: Citadel eggs). Stages: three names with `powerSteps` multiples of balance `pets.powerPerStage` added to max Power; the pet evolves when its Power crosses `pets.evolveAt`. Attacks: four minigame rolls `{ name, gameId, stake }` whose stake is paid from the pet's Power; `effect` marks the ones that heal or pay out instead of hitting (healTrainer, healSelf, gold, eatTurn). `swarm` species count as one pet with `pets.swarmBodies` bodies and lose a body per faint. Sprite key: pet/<id>_<stage>.",
